#: scenario3:scenario3_5F65D0CB_3C76_499E_AD53_CAB8E35B41DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 707e1f796d8dea939e1365a5ba074bfae2bd3a70d2fbb67ed36d0d99c7d8c72c
