#: scenario3:scenario3_0E06B623_797B_4A2C_A1AB_25AC1EADBEE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e332a266949665a9f6eb0e37aff9761dfa044abdc83e55fac0eb791f2c6c4d17
