msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I have told you before you are ⟪k:2⟫not⟪k:3⟫ to leave this house without first "
"consulting me! ⟪k:4⟫Or do you mean to tell me you’ve forgotten?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫私に黙って家を出るなと、⟪k:2⟫そう言ったのが分からんのか！　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫覚えていないとでも"
"言うのかね！？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BDEE98E1_A681_4ADE_8459_143BF942CBA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f5d832194c2e80dd5dfbdfd6483a3c078c278b416549482b2ed0d83ae632f72
