msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38AE51B4_B6ED_4722_A12E_51DA35244AA0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Silence! I have no interest in your excuses!⟪k:2⟫You’re always watching from the "
"shadows,⟪k:3⟫observing, trying not to step on anyone’s toes..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫うるさい！　⟪k:2⟫言い訳はまっぴらだ！　⟪k:3⟫いつだって君は、⟪k:4⟫他人の顔色を伺うような"
"低い態度で――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_20B7AA04_A4C6_467F_A6AD_6ECE7F691E53
