msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Listen up and listen good!⟪k:2⟫You just ⟪k:3⟫try⟪k:4⟫ stepping out of line again!⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫You just ⟪k:7⟫try⟪k:8⟫ disgracing me again!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫いいか、⟪k:2⟫これ以上勝手なことをしてみろ！　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私の顔に――泥を塗るような真似をし"
"てみろ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_21FE0FD0_961A_485F_B7C3_E41FC7C47088
