#: scenario3:scenario3_B9CA88EC_3D49_44B5_B9E7_506745E5DBC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 664977e45c9ebda6562f7d5c51e92eba14401366035037676d125a7f51b243b7
